Placeholder animations bundled with CYLTableViewPlaceHolder
===========================================================

Each file below was downloaded unmodified from the named open-source repository and commit, and renamed
for its placeholder scenario. The license of the source repository applies; its full text ships next to
this file. Playing Lottie, PAG and Rive files needs the CYLTableViewPlaceHolder/LottieSwift, /PAG and /Rive
subspecs; GIF plays with Core.

* Files that lottie-ios keeps under Tests/Samples/LottieFiles/ were contributed to that repository from
  lottiefiles.com. They are distributed here as part of the Apache-2.0 lottie-ios repository; replace them
  if your distribution requires a separate review of their original terms.

